. capture noisily nwsaom, waves(shares glasgow2) outdegree reciprocity k3(50)
nwsaom estimates on binary ties only (as RSiena, which stops on tie values other
>  than 0, 1, 10 and 11); shares is a valued network with the tie value .5 (dyad
>  1 -> 3). Dichotomize it first (nwdichotomize); nwsaom never turns tie values 
> into ties silently.
